Z||000005||theogre||08-29-99||09:35 PM||||FOCOSEVA? A Southern Club? What you think? I'm from Slower Delaware? <IMG SRC="/ubb/smile.gif" WIDTH=15 HEIGHT=15> <IMG SRC="/ubb/wink.gif" WIDTH=15 HEIGHT=15> <IMG SRC="/ubb/smile.gif" WIDTH=15 HEIGHT=15> <IMG SRC="/ubb/wink.gif" WIDTH=15 HEIGHT=15> <p>I don't generally see clubs as a great thing. A few, like MAFOA provide some fun like Carlisle, but most of it's a waste to me.<p>If people want to get together and screw off with our cars, then we don't need a club...... Some of you VA guys, and Some of you PA guys, meet me someplace in the middle and roll........ Those V6's might beat me out of the hole, but I bet you have a bitch of a time shaking that DIS motor off you ass on a long haul.<p>Hell, we've got more Fiero's in the delmarva pa nj area alone than you can shake a stick at...... Hmmmmm that give me an idea for a new thread.......
